# Hwatu — Go-Stop Mobile App

## One-liner

**Hwatu** is a mobile Go-Stop (고스톱) card game built with React Native + Expo. **Always Human vs AI** — you play against the computer at a chosen difficulty. Match Korean flower cards (화투) by month, collect scoring combinations, and decide when to **Stop** or risk it with **Go**.

Rules references:
- [화투(고스톱) 치는 방법 — 도까함 (Korean, primary)](https://ruabin1001.com/entry/%ED%99%94%ED%88%AC%EA%B3%A0%EC%8A%A4%ED%86%B1-%EC%B9%98%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95-%EA%B3%A0%EC%8A%A4%ED%86%B1-%EB%A3%B0%EA%B3%BC-%EC%A0%90%EC%88%98%EB%82%B4%EA%B8%B0-%ED%8C%A8-%EB%86%93%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95)
- [How to Play Go-Stop — Instructables](https://www.instructables.com/How-to-Play-Go-Stop/)

