## The Hwatu Deck

### Overview

- **48 cards** — 4 cards per month (January–December)
- Cards are matched by **month** (same flower/theme), not by sub-type
- Korean Hwatu decks may include **bonus/joker cards** — not in catalog yet (Phase 5 optional)

### Card Types (4 sub-categories)

| Type | Korean | Identification | Count |
|------|--------|----------------|-------|
| **Bright** | 광 (Gwang) | Chinese character 光 on red circle | 5 total |
| **Animal** | 열끗 (Yeol-kkeut) | Animals or special illustrations | 9 total (8 fixed + 1 flexible) |
| **Ribbon** | 띠 (Tti) | Blue or red ribbon bands | 10 total |
| **Junk** | 피 (Pi) | Plain filler cards | **25 pi total** (22 plain + 3 쌍피) |

> **September cup (9월 국화잔)** — card id `sep-animal-double`: scored as **열끗 (animal)** OR **쌍피 (+2 pi)** at collection. Third 쌍피 alongside `nov-junk-double` and `dec-junk-double`.

### Card Art (implemented)

Traditional Hanafuda-style artwork sourced from [Wikimedia Commons](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:SVG_Hanafuda) (Louie Mantia, Jr. and contributors, Korean hwatu adaptations by Marcus Richert). **CC BY-SA 4.0** — see `assets/cards/ATTRIBUTION.md`. Do not copy [도까함 blog](https://ruabin1001.com/entry/%ED%99%94%ED%88%AC%EA%B3%A0%EC%8A%A4%ED%86%B1-%EC%B9%98%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95-%EA%B3%A0%EC%8A%A4%ED%86%B1-%EB%A3%B0%EA%B3%BC-%EC%A0%90%EC%88%98%EB%82%B4%EA%B8%B0-%ED%8C%A8-%EB%86%93%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95) images (CC BY-NC-ND).

Use the 도까함 guide (광·띠·열끗·피 sections) as **rules reference only**, not as artwork source.

**Double-card ids** (count as 2 pi when scored as junk):

| Card id | Korean | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| `sep-animal-double` | 국화잔 | type `animal`, `flexPiAnimal` — 열끗 or 쌍피 |
| `nov-junk-double` | 쌍피 | |
| `dec-junk-double` | 쌍피 | |

### Month → Cards Map (implementation reference)

Each month has exactly 4 cards. Store as data, not hard-coded in UI:

```
January  (1):  Bright, Ribbon(red+writing), Junk×2
February (2):  Animal(nightingale), Ribbon(red+writing), Junk×2
March    (3):  Bright, Ribbon(red+writing), Junk×2
April    (4):  Animal(cuckoo), Ribbon(blue), Junk×2
May      (5):  Animal, Ribbon(blue), Junk×2
June     (6):  Animal, Ribbon(blue), Junk×2
July     (7):  Animal, Ribbon(plain red), Junk×2
August   (8):  Animal(geese), Bright, Ribbon(plain red), Junk
September(9):  Animal-double(cup, flex 열끗/쌍피 → sep-animal-double), Ribbon(plain red), Junk×2
October  (10): Animal(deer), Junk×3
November (11): Animal, Junk×2 + double-junk (counts as 2 피)
December (12): Bright(rain), Junk×2 + double-junk (counts as 2 피)
```

> **Rain Bright** (December): 3 Brights including rain = 2 points (비광). 3 Brights without rain = 3 points.

